\fR# 2\&.0\&.0\fP

.PP
\fRThis release contains the following breaking changes:\fP

.PP
\fR
.IP "\(bu" 2
Renamed all \fReachInside\fP iterators to \fRwalk\fP\&. For example, \fReachTag\fP is now \fRwalkTags\fP, and \fReachInside\fP is now \fRwalk\fP\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Renamed \fRNode#removeSelf()\fP to \fRNode#remove()\fP\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Renamed \fRContainer#remove()\fP to \fRContainer#removeChild()\fP\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Renamed \fRNode#raw\fP to \fRNode#raws\fP (thanks to @davidtheclark)\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Now parses \fR&\fP as the \fInesting\fP selector, rather than a \fItag\fP selector\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fixes misinterpretation of Sass interpolation (e\&.g\&. \fR#{foo}\fP) as an id selector (thanks to @davidtheclark)\&.
.PP
\fP

.PP
\fRand;\fP

.PP
\fR
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fixes parsing of attribute selectors with equals signs in them (e\&.g\&. \fR[data-attr="foo=bar"]\fP) (thanks to @montmanu)\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Adds \fRquoted\fP and \fRraw\&.unquoted\fP properties to attribute nodes (thanks to @davidtheclark)\&.
.PP
\fP

.PP
\fR\fP
.SH "\fR1\&.3\&.3\fP"
.PP
\fR\fP

.PP
\fR
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fixes an infinite loop on \fR)\fP and \fR]\fP tokens when they had no opening pairs\&. Now postcss-selector-parser will throw when it encounters these lone tokens\&.
.PP
\fP

.PP
\fR# 1\&.3\&.2\fP

.PP
\fR
.IP "\(bu" 2
Now uses plain integers rather than \fRstr\&.charCodeAt(0)\fP for compiled builds\&.
.PP
\fP

