.PP
\fR
.IP "\(bu" 2
Adds \fRnext\fP and \fRprev\fP to the node class\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Adds \fRfirst\fP and \fRlast\fP getters to the container class\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Adds \fRevery\fP and \fRsome\fP iterators to the container class\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Add \fRempty\fP alias for \fRremoveAll\fP\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Combinators are now types of node\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fixes the at method so that it is not an alias for \fRindex\fP\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Tidy up creation of new nodes in the parser\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Refactors how namespaces are handled for consistency & less redundant code\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Refactors AST to use \fRnodes\fP exclusively, and eliminates excessive nesting\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fixes nested pseudo parsing\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fixes whitespace parsing\&.
.PP
